    "notes": [
      "Do not release for manufacture until unresolved recess contour and edge treatments are resolved. F021 depends on the resolved F020 floor.",
      "The axis origin replaces the corner-offset coordinates in the prior extraction's instance arrays.",
      "Cartesian hole locations control. Neither six-hole group is replaced by a circular pattern because the printed coordinates do not close exactly on a common circle.",
      "The precision-land/relief association follows the section boundary at D001-D025; verify this fine line separation on the original print before manufacturing.",
      "D018 is reference only. Taper dimensions are derived from D017, D028 and the printed 15\u00b0 angle. Inspection balls are not part geometry.",
      "The rear thread is printed 8-32-2A. Confirm thread class before manufacture; do not silently substitute 2B.",
      "Material SAE 4340; heat treatment RKW C 45-50 per IE 107. Surface texture, D/GRIND, D and F are manufacturing metadata.",
      "Referenced IE standards are needed for proprietary hole suffixes A/B and historical tolerance interpretation. Preserve independent tolerances, particularly D004 versus D014.",
      "Counterbored holes with null depth have through smaller passages; blind enlargements retain their specified depths. Through and local-wall operations overshoot exits."
